{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13438","headline":"秋夜小洞庭离讌诗 · 苏源明","name":"秋夜小洞庭离讌诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浮涨湖兮莽迢遥，川后礼兮扈予桡。\n横增沃兮蓬仙延，川后福兮易予舷。\n月澄凝兮明空波，星磊落兮耿秋河。\n夜既良兮酒且多，乐方作兮奈别何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏源明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13438.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13438","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}